            <div xml:id="d659">

                <pb facs="0741" n="731" xml:id="pg731"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.385/29: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Atcheson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-07-31T23:00:00-04:00">July 31, 1943—11
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1003. Regret not practicable to reopen Consulate at or near Foochow now. Please
                    so inform committee mentioned your 1241 of July 21.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
